{
  "id": "ulla_talk",
  "start": "greet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "greet",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "She is stacking stones by the chapel wall, in an order that is not the order they came out of the cart. \"You've been in the mound.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "what_is_a_ward",
          "text": "What is a ward?",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "what_is_a_ward"
        },
        {
          "id": "nine",
          "text": "Hedda said there were nine.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": true,
          "lockedHint": "You have nothing to ask her about yet.",
          "goto": "nine",
          "requires": {
            "flags": [
              {
                "flag": "hedda_told",
                "equals": true
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "leave",
          "text": "Nothing.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": [
        {
          "requires": {
            "memories": [
              {
                "deedKind": "ward_broken",
                "who": "speaker"
              }
            ]
          },
          "goto": "she_knows"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "what_is_a_ward",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"A door that was shut on purpose, and a thing put by it to keep it shut.\" She sets a stone. \"Cairns are wards. The Thornward's a ward. Your barrow was a ward and now it isn't.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "who_built",
          "text": "Who built them?",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "who_built"
        },
        {
          "id": "back",
          "text": "Hm.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "greet"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "who_built",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"People who could count to nine and didn't write anything down where you'd find it.\" She looks at you properly for the first time. \"There's a list. The Library has it and won't say so, and the Crown has a copy and won't admit it.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "thanks",
          "text": "That's useful.",
          "effects": [
            {
              "setFlag": {
                "flag": "knows_about_wardlist",
                "value": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "greet"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "nine",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"Nine,\" she agrees. \"And three of them have gone in a year. Whatever's doing it is going in order and it is not slowing down.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "back",
          "text": "Right.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "greet"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "she_knows",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "She does not stop stacking. \"I heard what you did to the ward.\" A stone goes down harder than it needs to. \"Say what you came to say.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "apologise",
          "text": "It had to come down.",
          "effects": [
            {
              "adjustReputation": {
                "faction": "the_keepers",
                "amount": -3
              }
            }
          ],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "greet"
        },
        {
          "id": "leave",
          "text": "Nothing.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    }
  ]
}
